### Clinic Appointment System — API request collection
### COMP713 Assignment 2 (Option A)
###
### Use with the VS Code REST Client extension while the system is running:
###     .\mvnw.cmd spring-boot:run
### Expected results are noted above each request. Identical JSON payloads for
### curl.exe live in this folder as *.json — on Windows PowerShell, inline JSON in
### `curl -d` gets mangled, so curl uses `--data-binary "@requests\file.json"`
### (see README "Testing the main functions").
###
### The ids used below assume a fresh start with the demo seed (patients 1-3,
### appointments 1-4) plus the registration request in this file (patient 4) and
### one booking (appointment 5).

### ------------------------------------------------------------------
### Patients
### ------------------------------------------------------------------

### List all patients (200, ordered by last name)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/patients

### Filter by last name, case-insensitive (200, one match)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/patients?lastName=ngata

### Patient detail including appointments (200)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/patients/1

### Unknown patient (404 PATIENT_NOT_FOUND)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/patients/999

### Register a patient (201 + Location: .../api/v1/patients/4)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Mere",
  "lastName": "Wiremu",
  "email": "mere.wiremu@example.com",
  "phone": "021 555 0111"
}

### Duplicate e-mail (409 PATIENT_EXISTS)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Aroha",
  "lastName": "Copy",
  "email": "aroha.ngata@example.com"
}

### Invalid body: blank first name + malformed e-mail (400 INVALID_REQUEST)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "",
  "lastName": "Wiremu",
  "email": "not-an-email"
}

### Malformed JSON body (400 INVALID_REQUEST)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{ not json

### ------------------------------------------------------------------
### Appointments (fixed weekday dates far in the future keep the results stable)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------

### Read a booked slot (200)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/appointments/5

### Book a free slot for patient 4 (201 + Location: .../api/v1/appointments/5)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/patients/4/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startAt": "2030-01-07T10:00:00",
  "durationMinutes": 30,
  "reason": "Consultation"
}

### Overlapping slot for the same patient (409 APPOINTMENT_CONFLICT)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/patients/4/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startAt": "2030-01-07T10:15:00",
  "durationMinutes": 30,
  "reason": "Should clash"
}

### Identical start time (409 APPOINTMENT_CONFLICT)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/patients/4/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startAt": "2030-01-07T10:00:00",
  "durationMinutes": 30,
  "reason": "Same start"
}

### Slot in the past (400 APPOINTMENT_TIME_INVALID)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/patients/4/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startAt": "2020-01-06T10:00:00",
  "durationMinutes": 30,
  "reason": "Too late"
}

### Weekend slot (400 APPOINTMENT_TIME_INVALID)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/patients/4/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startAt": "2030-01-06T10:00:00",
  "durationMinutes": 30,
  "reason": "Sunday attempt"
}

### Before opening hours (400 APPOINTMENT_TIME_INVALID)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/patients/4/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startAt": "2030-01-07T08:00:00",
  "durationMinutes": 30,
  "reason": "Too early"
}

### Missing durationMinutes (400 INVALID_REQUEST)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/patients/4/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startAt": "2030-01-07T10:00:00"
}

### Book for an unknown patient (404 PATIENT_NOT_FOUND)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/patients/999/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startAt": "2030-01-07T10:00:00",
  "durationMinutes": 30,
  "reason": "Consultation"
}

### Reschedule appointment 5 (200, moved slot)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/appointments/5
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startAt": "2030-01-08T14:00:00",
  "durationMinutes": 45,
  "reason": "Moved"
}

### Cancel appointment 5 (204, empty body)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/appointments/5

### Read the cancelled appointment (404 APPOINTMENT_NOT_FOUND)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/appointments/5

### ------------------------------------------------------------------
### Health
### ------------------------------------------------------------------

### Actuator health check (200 {"status":"UP"})
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health
